{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:17:38+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brownie's Adventure 2", "steam_appid": 2905080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905080/extras/a7d7a64c07209a6d84731f4c4c17050c.poster.avif?t=1726774307\" width=500 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905080/extras/a7d7a64c07209a6d84731f4c4c17050c.webm?t=1726774307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Return to the delightfully absurd world of Brownie's Adventure! Dive headfirst into a 1990s-style, point-and-click comedy that blends fantasy with the quirky charm of post-apocalyptic Northern Britain. Think classic 90s puzzle-solving, character-driven storytelling—but with more twists, surprises, and the occasional bizarre encounter. Chat with eccentric townsfolk, hold conversations with animated trees, and solve increasingly strange puzzles as you guide Brownie on his quest for redemption.<br><br>Your choices shape the game—altering dialogue, characters, and setting the stage for the inevitable (but thrilling!) final showdown. And if you get stuck, fear not! The hint system—based on hunting down elusive 'Kluberries'—is there to give you a nudge in the right direction.<br><br>Explore the crumbling ruins of Sheffield, sail through a bustling fantasy realm, and embark on an epic quest that spans both worlds. Will you survive the laugh-out-loud moments, dark humor, and fiendishly tricky puzzles to save both realities? Oh, and did I mention the magical laser battles with whippets and disgruntled climbers? No? Well, yeah... that’s in here too. Definitely worth a mention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://